lens 0.0->1.0: v1_0.count copies v0_0.count, which is now int & <10, which does not accept every value of the prior int (compat rule value-narrowed) (rule copy-narrowed):
    ship/1.0.thema:7:9
lens 0.0->1.0: v1_0.count copies v0_0.count, which may be absent: v0_0.count is optional in the source schema; write the field under if v0_0.count != _|_ (rule source-absent):
    ship/1.0.thema:7:9
